theme_override_colors/default_color = Color(0.901961, 0.901961, 0.901961, 1)
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 15
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[b]1. List[/b]
[code]bag = [][/code]　[code]bag.append(\"key\")[/code]　[code]bag.remove(\"key\")[/code]

[b]2. for 迴圈[/b]
[code]for day in range(100, 0, -1): ...[/code]

[b]3. random / while[/b]
不確定要重複幾次時，用 [code]while 條件:[/code] 搭配 [code]random.choice([...])[/code]。"
